  "privacy": "Privacy & security",
  "privacySummary": "How FamNest keeps your family's data private",
  "privacyBody": "• No internet or cloud: messages travel only over your home Wi-Fi between your family's devices.\n\n• Everything you see is stored only on this device. Chats are excluded from cloud backups.\n\n• Joining requires the family invite code. Devices and the hub verify each other, and all traffic is encrypted (AES-256-GCM).\n\n• Messages, photos, files, names and profile photos are end-to-end encrypted. The hub stores only encrypted data it cannot read.\n\n• Direct chats use a key only the two of you share, so other family members can't read them either.\n\n• Removing a member and issuing a new invite code locks them out.",
